cratic win near 96 percent. Polling reported in late September showed Becerra holding wide leads, though a tabloid report of a tighter survey hints at some volatility.\n\nFundraising is roughly even, with Hilton raising about $7.3 million to Becerra's $6.1 million and holding more cash on hand, but money has not translated into a ratings or polling case for an upset. Debates in late September and early October were testy, with Becerra leaning on Trump-focused attacks and Hilton blaming Democratic governance. Four weeks out, the race sits firmly in Democratic territory.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9963, "margin": 17.38}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.998, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9982, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.998, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9936, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9916, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.996, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9966, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9966, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.998, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9808, "margin": 14.8}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9828, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9795, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9678, "margin": 13.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9677, "margin": 13.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9665, "margin": 13.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9753, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9796, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9687, "margin": 13.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9758, "margin": 15.0}]}